        "created_at": "2025-01-29T17:21:30.174Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/c/c/cc388fb671da705c5d994092f59f76363bdace68.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/t8CAldmIW4yuXaXzFKmV3J4pUa4.png?dl=1\" title=\"bpt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/c/c/cc388fb671da705c5d994092f59f76363bdace68.png\" alt=\"bpt\" data-base62-sha1=\"t8CAldmIW4yuXaXzFKmV3J4pUa4\" width=\"690\" height=\"128\" data-dominant-color=\"202424\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">bpt</span><span class=\"informations\">1021×190 9.47 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Does the above status mean that the BPT is submitted and the evaluation is possible? I have completed all the problems and the evaluation as well(using synchro eval).<br>\nOR<br>\nIs there a different portal that I need to submit it to after this evaluation?<br>\nPlease help. Thank you.</p>",
